distiller-cm5-python (1.0.0-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release of Distiller CM5 Python AI Assistant Application
  * Dual interface architecture supporting both CLI and Qt/QML GUI modes
  * LLM integration with local llama-cpp servers and remote providers
  * MCP (Model Context Protocol) server support for extensible tool integration
  * Hardware interfacing capabilities including audio, display, and LED control
  * Speech-to-text processing with faster_whisper for voice interaction
  * E-ink display control via distiller-cm5-sdk integration
  * UART-based power management signaling for system integration
  * Modular LLM integration with automatic server lifecycle management
  * Comprehensive configuration system supporting multiple LLM providers
  * SystemD service integration for CLI and GUI daemon modes
  * Professional packaging with proper dependency management using uv
  * Security features including dedicated system user and proper permissions
  * Hardware abstraction layer with graceful degradation when unavailable
  * Qt/QML-based voice assistant interface with visual feedback
  * Multi-threaded architecture for responsive user interaction
  * Comprehensive logging and error handling throughout the application
  * Integration with broader Distiller CM5 ecosystem via shared SDK

 -- PamirAI Incorporated <support@pamir.ai>  Thu, 10 Jul 2025 12:00:00 +0000
